<title>CANADA: UGG estimates W. Canada barley supply/disposition.</title>
<headline>UGG estimates W. Canada barley supply/disposition.</headline>
<dateline>WINNIPEG 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>United Grain Growers has detailed its estimate of supply and disposition of western Canadian barley based on a farmer survey by United Grain Growers elevator managers between June 2 and 4.</p>
<p>			     WESTERN CANADA ('000 T)</p>
<p>	   Forecast 97/98    Forecast 96/97   Five-Yr-Avg</p>
<p>Supply</p>
<p>Openg Stox 3,122		 1,806		2,745</p>
<p>Output    15,733		15,912	     12,069</p>
<p>Total     18,859		17,722	     14,819</p>
<p>Disposition</p>
<p>Exports    3,400		 3,400		3,044</p>
<p>Seed	   400		   400		  397</p>
<p>Human Food 1,100		 1,000		  791</p>
<p>Feed/Waste 9,600		 9,800		8,009</p>
<p>Total     14,500		14,600	     12,241</p>
<p>Carry Out  4,359		 3,122		2,577</p>
<p>((Gilbert Le Gras, Winnipeg Reuters bureau 204 947 3548))</p>
</text>
